# Lp-Reg

## Preview

We are currently integrating Lp-Reg into the latest version of [veRL](https://github.com/volcengine/verl) to provide a cleaner, more streamlined implementation.

To reproduce the results reported in our paper, please use the code in our development repository: [Lp-Reg-dev](https://github.com/CarlanLark/Lp-Reg-dev).